{"version":1,"content":"<p>金像影后余香凝（Jennifer）之妹余潔滢（Zoe）日前穿上白色低胸連身裙出席馬場活動後，隨即起程往泰國度假，跟陽光玩遊戲，過個熱辣辣的11月。</p><p>她在社交網上載穿粉藍色一件頭的泳衣照，泳衣腰部的開窿設計，凸顯其小纖腰，還有一對無敵長腿任睇，</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:23:57.566150+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T07:01:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T07:17:12.945092+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T07:17:12.945092+00:00","content_hash":"6a46f90a4dbb22ae9ad61b7aae16db128e998dbd97fd26e12ed152f285521833","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}